# Source-generated coefficient strong continuation

The source-generated mild state already carries an actual nonlinear
`L²_t H⁻¹_x` forcing.  Its viscous part now lives in that same whole carrier,
so the first strong-solution estimate is an explicit time-derivative bound
for the genuine tangent `N(ω) - ν(-Δ)ω`.

The continuous whole-state mild path and its all-time bound are joined to
this tangent below.  No strong solution, endpoint state, continuation
target, or tail witness is accepted as input.
-/

